{"type":"user","uuid":"01a1b631-f65d-747a-951f-06c0227e1c4b","session_id":"01a1b631-833e-7cce-99be-733d57cd5e95","message":{"content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_00_ZEFrbzPWliRLlq5bitUU4842","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  20→    {\n  21→      \"id\": \"M5\",\n  22→      \"title\": \"插件与交付：路由分级与会话自举、健康检查、界面、跨进程 e2e、安装回滚、文档、smoke、发布门禁；A 节缺陷全部翻转的判定点\"\n  23→    }\n  24→  ],\n  25→  \"acceptance\": [\n  26→    {\n  27→      \"id\": \"AC-001\",\n  28→      \"text\": \"npm test 以 0 退出。run-tests 枚举 test 下 unit、integration、contract、e2e、smoke、characterization、flows 中的 *.test.mjs，排除 test/fixtures、test/helpers、test/perf。完整运行写 files-executed.json（mode:'full'），并当场断言枚举集合与 reporter 实际执行集合相等；--ac 过滤运行只写 mode:'filtered'，不做相等比较。check-test-discovery 用夹具自测：能检出不一致；filtered 清单不能满足完整校验；放在 test/fixtures 下的 x.test.mjs 不会被执行。\",\n  29→      \"levels\": [\n  30→        \"unit\"\n  31→      ]\n  32→    },\n  33→    {\n  34→      \"id\": \"AC-002\",\n  35→      \"text\": \"check-ci 校验 .github/workflows/ci.yml 是由 scripts/ci-matrix.json 生成的最新版本；矩阵含 os ubuntu、windows、macos 与 node 20、22，每格运行 npm run check 并上传 files-executed.json 与 skips.jsonl；perf 作业单独存在且标为不阻断。\",\n  36→      \"levels\": [\n  37→        \"unit\"\n  38→      ]\n  39→    },\n  40→    {\n  41→      \"id\": \"AC-003\",\n  42→"}],"is_error":false}],"role":"user"},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b631861d76b2a08c72bb6c9ff9ad","_messageId":"01a1b631ed277be6914aa5633512da0f","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b631861d76b2a08c72bb6c9ff9ad","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b631ed277be6914aa5633512da0f","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b631ed277be6914aa5633512da0f","traceparent":"00-f1d3e59acc86b4a7b6caa1170d79b2ee-5201346c6ef2d0a0-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b631-833e-7cce-99be-733d57cd5e95,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b631861d76b2a08c72bb6c9ff9ad"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:28:10.078Z"}
{"type":"user","uuid":"01a1b631-f661-767f-a5ab-c64df097ee8a","session_id":"01a1b631-833e-7cce-99be-733d57cd5e95","message":{"content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_01_VGfFlhPyEmSTtbx7RdlL9857","content":[{"type":"text","text":" 445→    {\n 446→      \"id\": \"AC-060\",\n 447→      \"text\": \"管理写路由的判定顺序：无会话返回 403 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED（即使 readonly 且缺 csrf）；会话有效且 readonly 返回 403 E_READONLY（即使缺 csrf）；会话有效、可写、缺 csrf 或 csrf 不匹配返回 403 E_CSRF；用同一次 api/session 响应中的 session 和 csrf 发出的首个写请求成功。flows 的 http-select 与 http-admin 步骤中，leak-scan 对 HTTP 响应体的哨兵检查 0 命中。\",\n 448→      \"levels\": [\n 449→        \"integration\"\n 450→      ]\n 451→    },\n 452→    {\n 453→      \"id\": \"AC-061\",\n 454→      \"text\": \"doctor 与 /cliworker/health 都报告：配置有效性、state_dir 是否可写、锁状态、密钥后端、清单年龄、过期探测数量、注册状态、test_clock。注入任一故障（含设置 CLIWORKER_TEST_CLOCK_FILE）时，doctor 以 E_HEALTH_DEGRADED 退出（退出码 9），health 返回 status degraded 并列出故障项。\",\n 455→      \"levels\": [\n 456→        \"integration\",\n 457→        \"unit\"\n 458→      ]\n 459→    },\n 460→    {\n 461→      \"id\": \"AC-062\",\n 462→      \"text\": \"ui/render.mjs 的纯函数测试：六列齐全；缺失或过期的值显示 unknown 或 stale，并附 source 和 at；输出中不出现由缺失数据生成的 0 或 100%；assumed 渲染为「unknown（估计 N，assumed）」。\",\n 463→      \"levels\": [\n 464→        \"unit\"\n 465→      ]\n 466→    },\n 467→    {\n 468→      \"id\": \"AC-063\",\n 469→      \"text\": \"界面外壳先请求 api/session，再带会话头轮询 api/snapshot，期间 exec 计数为 0；会话失效时收到 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED 并重新签发；刷新和探测走 job 接口并返回 job_id；job 失败时，snapshot 中该项保留上次的值、标为 stale，并给出 last_error 和 at。\",\n 470→      \"levels\": [\n 471→        \"integration\"\n 472→      ]\n 473→    },\n 474→    {\n 475→"}],"is_error":false}],"role":"user"},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b631861d76b2a08c72bb6c9ff9ad","_messageId":"01a1b631ed277be6914aa5633512da0f","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b631861d76b2a08c72bb6c9ff9ad","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b631ed277be6914aa5633512da0f","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b631ed277be6914aa5633512da0f","traceparent":"00-f1d3e59acc86b4a7b6caa1170d79b2ee-5201346c6ef2d0a0-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b631-833e-7cce-99be-733d57cd5e95,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b631861d76b2a08c72bb6c9ff9ad"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:28:10.082Z"}
